GET http://localhost:9090/ngsi-ld/v1/entities?type=libelium-weather HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/ld+json
Link: <http://context-hoster/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.8.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"
